  m_text: "\u2462 Procedure\r\nA procedure combines a method and a tool so that they
    can be used to develop software in a rational and timely fashion.\r\nThe procedure
    defines the applied method, required deliverables (documents, reports, etc.),
    controls to guarantee quality and assist coordinate adjustment, and the sequence
    of milestones that enable software managers to evaluate progress.\r\n"
