  m_text: 'This is an important activity for corporations to tailor the development
    process of a project.

    Selection is based on the risk and uncertainty of
    system development and understanding of it.

    The selected model should be
    able to minimize the risks and uncertainties associated with a given project.

    The
    Waterfall model, prototype model, evolutionary model, and incremental model are
    the most representative life cycle models.

'
