  m_text: 'These words accurately describe the current situation facing companies.
    As we enter the intelligent information society represented by Industry 4.0,
    software has emerged as a key driver of digital transformation and enterprises
    have their competitors strained in the industry by creating a new business model
    that did not exist before the widespread adoption of software.

'
